Gate under test (UNMODIFIED at time of this run): .proof-os/gates/F-0238-no-fabricated-contract-pdf.sh
Scratch tree: <scratchpad>/f0266-correct/src/components/brand/deal-room/deal-contract-tab.tsx

Scratch tree is CORRECT: downloadContractPDF is not reachable from the live branch
(liveApi && isApiLive => fetchRealContract(); the fabricated-data branch is demo-only
