  2. a trailing same-line comment: `const legacyToastRemoved = true; // used to read: "Opened a local copy"`
  3. a standalone JSX comment: `{/* Historically this toast said "Opened a local copy" ... */}`

Command:
  bash .proof-os/gates/F-0238-no-fabricated-contract-pdf.sh "<scratchpad>/f0266-correct"

