  VERDICT: broken (F-0238 regressed)
  NOT CHECKED: whether the live failure message is understandable, or runtime behaviour

Observed exit code: 1

CONCLUSION: false negative confirmed. The gate reports a correct tree as REGRESSED
because its comment-stripping cannot see case 2 (trailing comment) and case 3 (JSX
